/P 942 0 R
/E ( SnapCash is a digital Point of Sale \(POS\) system designed to help small and medium-sized businesses, especially in the food and retail sectors, manage their daily operations efficiently. The system provides features such as transaction processing, inventory management, financial reporting, and business analytics in one integrated platform. By using SnapCash, businesses can digitize their operations, reduce manual errors, and gain insights into their financial performance.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
