1908 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 990 0 R
/E (After market validation, SnapCash expands to major cities: Bandung, Surabaya, and Yogyakarta. Focus shifts from product development to customer acquisition and user experience improvement. A sales and customer success team is built to onboard MSMEs unfamiliar with digital tools.)
